{"format":"helia-content","version":1,"id":"monadicity-comonadicity","title":{"Inline":[{"Text":"Monadicity and comonadicity"}]},"title_text":"Monadicity and comonadicity","kind":"definition","taxon":null,"url":"monadicity-comonadicity.html","content":{"Block":[{"Group":{"role":"env","attrs":[["entry","monadicity-comonadicity"],["kind","definition"],["label","Definition"],["numbered","true"]],"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"An adjunction "},{"Math":{"src":"F ⊣ U"}},{"Text":" with "},{"Math":{"src":"F : cal(C) -> cal(D)"}},{"Text":" and "},{"Math":{"src":"U : cal(D) -> cal(C)"}},{"Text":" induces a monad "},{"Math":{"src":"T = U ∘ F"}},{"Text":" on "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":", and a "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"comparison-functor","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"comparison functor"}]}}]},{"Math":{"src":"K : cal(D) -> \"EM\" lr(( T ))"}},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"sending each object of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(D)"}},{"Text":" to the "},{"Math":{"src":"T"}},{"Text":"-algebra it carries."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"The functor "},{"Math":{"src":"U"}},{"Text":" is "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"monadic"}]},{"Text":" when "},{"Math":{"src":"K"}},{"Text":" is an equivalence: the adjunction exhibits "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(D)"}},{"Text":" as objects of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":" equipped with algebraic structure for "},{"Math":{"src":"T"}},{"Text":", the "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"eilenberg-moore-displayed","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"Eilenberg–Moore category"}]}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Emph":[{"Text":"Comonadicity"}]},{"Text":" is monadicity in the opposite category: a left adjoint "},{"Math":{"src":"L : cal(D) -> cal(C)"}},{"Text":" with right adjoint "},{"Math":{"src":"R"}},{"Text":" induces a comonad "},{"Math":{"src":"W = L ∘ R"}},{"Text":" on "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":", a comparison "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(D) -> \"coEM\" lr(( W ))"}},{"Text":" into the "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"co-eilenberg-moore-displayed","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"co-Eilenberg–Moore category"}]}},{"Text":", and "},{"Math":{"src":"L"}},{"Text":" is comonadic when this comparison is an equivalence."}]}]}}}]}}
